{"title":"Geometry/Introduction","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Introductory_Topics_in_Geometry\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory Topics in Geometry</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Introductory_Geometry_Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory Geometry Resources</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Classes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Classes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory_Topics_in_Geometry\">Introductory Topics in Geometry</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Introduction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory Topics in Geometry\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The following topics make a good introduction to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">geometry</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=3D_Geometry\" title=\"3D Geometry\">3D Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">Area</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circle\" title=\"Circle\">Circles</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power_of_a_point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power of a point\">Power of a point</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Similarity\" title=\"Similarity\">Similarity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\"> Triangles</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">Right triangles</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Triangle inequality\">Triangle inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pythagorean Inequality\">Pythagorean Inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Similar_triangles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Similar triangles\">Similar triangles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle_Bisector_Theorem\" title=\"Angle Bisector Theorem\">Angle Bisector Theorem</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parallel\" title=\"Parallel\"> Parallel lines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polygon\" title=\"Polygon\">Polygons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadrilateral\" title=\"Quadrilateral\">Quadrilaterals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_Inequality\" title=\"Triangle Inequality\">Triangle Inequality</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory_Geometry_Resources\">Introductory Geometry Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Introduction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory Geometry Resources\">edit</a><span c